<% layout("/layouts/admin", { page: it.page }) %>
<%~ include("/partials/admin-nav", { page: it.page, items: it.navItems || [] }) %>
<main id="main-content">
  <header class="page-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">Telemetry</p>
    <h1><%= it.page.title %></h1>
    <p>This is the only time Tapboard will display this machine key. Copy it to the source before leaving this page.</p>
  </header>
  <section class="admin-card one-time-secret" aria-labelledby="key-heading">
    <h2 id="key-heading"><%= it.source.name %></h2>
    <p class="warning"><strong>Store this key securely.</strong> It cannot be recovered after this page is closed.</p>
    <p id="machine-key-label">Machine key</p>
    <output id="machine-key" class="one-time-secret__value" aria-labelledby="machine-key-label"><%= it.machineKey %></output>
    <h3>Send Tap 1 measurements</h3>
    <p>Endpoint</p>
    <p><code><%= it.endpointUrl %></code></p>
    <p>Use the full machine key as the Bearer token. The example uses a valid <code>total_weight</code> measurement in grams.</p>
    <pre><code>curl --fail-with-body --request POST "<%= it.endpointUrl %>" \
  --header "Authorization: Bearer <%= it.machineKey %>" \
  --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
  --data '{"client_sample_id":"sample-001","measured_at":"2026-08-17T12:00:00Z","measurement":{"kind":"total_weight","value":10000,"unit":"g"},"temperature":{"value":4,"unit":"c"}}'</code></pre>
    <p>To replace this key later, return to the source and rotate it. Rotation revokes the previous key immediately.</p>
    <p><a class="button secondary button--small" href="<%= it.page.returnPath || "/admin/integrations/telemetry" %>">Return to Telemetry</a></p>
  </section>
</main>
